{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2023-05-01 17:10:00', 'title': 'BUNGE LAUNCHES PROGRAM TO DRIVE REGENERATIVE AGRICULTURE IN BRAZIL', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE ANNOUNCED THE CREATION OF A REGENERATIVE AGRICULTURE PROGRAM TO SUPPORT BRAZILIAN FARMERS IN THE TRANSITION TO LOW-CARBON AGRICULTURE, OFFERING TECHNICAL SUPPORT, TOOLS, PRODUCTS, AND SERVICES, WHILE SUPPORTING GLOBAL EFFORTS TO MINIMIZE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS. THE PROGRAM, WHICH WILL BE OFFERED AT NO COST FOR FARMERS, PROMOTES GROWTH IN PRODUCTIVITY AND REDUCTION OF COSTS THROUGH THE APPLICATION OF CULTIVATION BEST PRACTICES THAT IMPROVE SOIL FERTILITY.'}